# YouTube Channel Dashboard using Power BI

## Project Overview
This project presents a YouTube channel dashboard created using Microsoft Power BI to analyze YouTube video performance.

## Objectives
- Analyze video views and engagement.
- Visualize key performance metrics.
- Identify trends using charts and graphs.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Data Visualization

## Project Preview
Dashboard screenshots are available in the Screenshots folder.

## Key Learnings
- Data visualization
- Dashboard design
- Data analysis and interpretation
